{"id":"n09d6b2abb3cc","url":"https://www.dental-tribune.com/news/heygears-to-showcase-dental-3d-printing-workflows-at-formnext-2026/","title":"HeyGears to showcase dental 3D-printing workflows at Formnext 2026","source":"Dental Tribune","date":"2026-11-03T08:46:32.000Z","byline":"HeyGears","image":"https://cdn.dental-tribune.com/dti/0001/e49b16d6/cmVzaXplLWNyb3Aodz0xMjAwO2g9NjI3KTpzaGFycGVuKGxldmVsPTApOm91dHB1dChmb3JtYXQ9anBlZyk/up/dt/2026/10/HeyGears-to-showcase-dental-3D-printing-workflows-at-Formnext%E2%80%AF2026.jpg","imageKind":"","imageBg":"","html":"<img src=\"https://cdn.dental-tribune.com/dti/0001/23e40a4b/cmVzaXplLWNyb3Aodz00MDA7aD00MDApOnNoYXJwZW4obGV2ZWw9MCk6b3V0cHV0KGZvcm1hdD1naWYp/wp-content/themes/dt/images/no-user.gif\" alt=\"HeyGears\" loading=\"lazy\"> <p>HeyGears</p> <p>Tue.  3. November 2026</p> share save <h2><p>FRANKFURT AM MAIN, Germany: HeyGears will showcase its latest advances in digital dental production at Formnext 2026, taking place from 17 to 20 November in Frankfurt am Main. Its presentation will include automated multi-application production, dual-material denture printing and high-transparency printing workflows. HeyGears’ participation in Formnext will focus on how connected digital technologies can help dental laboratories and clinics move towards more integrated, efficient and scalable manufacturing.</p>\n</h2> <p>Automation will be a major theme of HeyGears’ participation in Formnext. The company will present an end-to-end production approach for dental models and other applications, such as splints, denture bases, trays and surgical guides. The approach combines artificial intelligence-powered design and on-demand human design services with automated preprocessing, 3D printing and intelligent sorting. For high-volume production, HeyGears will present the UltraCraft A3D printer, which offers automated resin refill, automatic part removal and integration with HeyGears Cloud, its digital production management platform. The system is designed to support scalable production across multiple dental applications.</p>\n<p>HeyGears will also demonstrate how HeyGears Cloud connects different stages of digital production. The platform can automatically consolidate orders, preprocess production files, distribute tasks among connected equipment and monitor production. In this demonstration, HeyGears Cloud will be linked with the UltraCraft A3D to illustrate how they work together throughout the production chain.</p>\n<picture><source srcset=\"https://cdn.dental-tribune.com/dti/0001/a643b006/cmVzaXplKHc9MTMyMDtoPTk3Nik6c2hhcnBlbihsZXZlbD0wKTpvdXRwdXQoZm9ybWF0PXdlYnAp/up/dt/2026/10/HeyGears-to-showcase-dental-3D-printing-workflows-at-Formnext-2026-6.jpg 1320w, https://cdn.dental-tribune.com/dti/0001/34f56475/cmVzaXplKHc9Mjk3O2g9MjIwKTpzaGFycGVuKGxldmVsPTApOm91dHB1dChmb3JtYXQ9d2VicCk/up/dt/2026/10/HeyGears-to-showcase-dental-3D-printing-workflows-at-Formnext-2026-6.jpg 297w, https://cdn.dental-tribune.com/dti/0001/39ad3d37/cmVzaXplKHc9NDYyO2g9MzQyKTpzaGFycGVuKGxldmVsPTApOm91dHB1dChmb3JtYXQ9d2VicCk/up/dt/2026/10/HeyGears-to-showcase-dental-3D-printing-workflows-at-Formnext-2026-6.jpg 462w, https://cdn.dental-tribune.com/dti/0001/e4e360e0/cmVzaXplKHc9NjYwO2g9NDg4KTpzaGFycGVuKGxldmVsPTApOm91dHB1dChmb3JtYXQ9d2VicCk/up/dt/2026/10/HeyGears-to-showcase-dental-3D-printing-workflows-at-Formnext-2026-6.jpg 660w, https://cdn.dental-tribune.com/dti/0001/128024d1/cmVzaXplKHc9OTkwO2g9NzMyKTpzaGFycGVuKGxldmVsPTApOm91dHB1dChmb3JtYXQ9d2VicCk/up/dt/2026/10/HeyGears-to-showcase-dental-3D-printing-workflows-at-Formnext-2026-6.jpg 990w, https://cdn.dental-tribune.com/dti/0001/e875af62/cmVzaXplKHc9MTY1MDtoPTEyMjApOnNoYXJwZW4obGV2ZWw9MCk6b3V0cHV0KGZvcm1hdD13ZWJwKQ/up/dt/2026/10/HeyGears-to-showcase-dental-3D-printing-workflows-at-Formnext-2026-6.jpg 1650w, https://cdn.dental-tribune.com/dti/0001/aa72c27d/cmVzaXplKHc9MTk4MDtoPTE0NjQpOnNoYXJwZW4obGV2ZWw9MCk6b3V0cHV0KGZvcm1hdD13ZWJwKQ/up/dt/2026/10/HeyGears-to-showcase-dental-3D-pr