owcase-dental-3D-printing-workflows-at-Formnext-2026-6.jpg 1980w, https://cdn.dental-tribune.com/dti/0001/e3961357/cmVzaXplKHc9MjMxMDtoPTE3MDgpOnNoYXJwZW4obGV2ZWw9MCk6b3V0cHV0KGZvcm1hdD1qcGVnKQ/up/dt/2026/10/HeyGears-to-showcase-dental-3D-printing-workflows-at-Formnext-2026-6.jpg 2310w, https://cdn.dental-tribune.com/dti/0001/32b04664/cmVzaXplKHc9MjY0MDtoPTE5NTIpOnNoYXJwZW4obGV2ZWw9MCk6b3V0cHV0KGZvcm1hdD1qcGVnKQ/up/dt/2026/10/HeyGears-to-showcase-dental-3D-printing-workflows-at-Formnext-2026-6.jpg 2640w\" type=\"image/jpeg\"><img src=\"https://cdn.dental-tribune.com/dti/0001/53b1435e/cmVzaXplKHc9MTMyMDtoPTk3Nik6c2hhcnBlbihsZXZlbD0wKTpvdXRwdXQoZm9ybWF0PWpwZWcp/up/dt/2026/10/HeyGears-to-showcase-dental-3D-printing-workflows-at-Formnext-2026-6.jpg\" alt=\"The UltraCraft A3D supports automated, scalable production across multiple dental applications, and the UltraCraft A2D HD is designed for high-transparency printing workflows. (Image: HeyGears)\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\t</picture><p>The UltraCraft A3D supports automated, scalable production across multiple dental applications, and the UltraCraft A2D HD is designed for high-transparency printing workflows. (Image: HeyGears)</p><picture><source srcset=\"https://cdn.dental-tribune.com/dti/0001/32bf8ad1/cmVzaXplKHc9MTMyMDtoPTk3Nik6c2hhcnBlbihsZXZlbD0wKTpvdXRwdXQoZm9ybWF0PXdlYnAp/up/dt/2026/10/HeyGears-to-showcase-dental-3D-printing-workflows-at-Formnext-2026-5.jpg 1320w, https://cdn.dental-tribune.com/dti/0001/0189b582/cmVzaXplKHc9Mjk3O2g9MjIwKTpzaGFycGVuKGxldmVsPTApOm91dHB1dChmb3JtYXQ9d2VicCk/up/dt/2026/10/HeyGears-to-showcase-dental-3D-printing-workflows-at-Formnext-2026-5.jpg 297w, https://cdn.dental-tribune.com/dti/0001/9815abca/cmVzaXplKHc9NDYyO2g9MzQyKTpzaGFycGVuKGxldmVsPTApOm91dHB1dChmb3JtYXQ9d2VicCk/up/dt/2026/10/HeyGears-to-showcase-dental-3D-printing-workflows-at-Formnext-2026-5.jpg 462w, https://cdn.dental-tribune.com/dti/0001/35d0afde/cmVzaXplKHc9NjYwO2g9NDg4KTpzaGFycGVuKGxldmVsPTApOm91dHB1dChmb3JtYXQ9d2VicCk/up/