b3JtYXQ9anBlZyk/up/dt/2026/10/HeyGears-to-showcase-dental-3D-printing-workflows-at-Formnext-2026-5.jpg 660w, https://cdn.dental-tribune.com/dti/0001/307d1ec3/cmVzaXplKHc9OTkwO2g9NzMyKTpzaGFycGVuKGxldmVsPTApOm91dHB1dChmb3JtYXQ9anBlZyk/up/dt/2026/10/HeyGears-to-showcase-dental-3D-printing-workflows-at-Formnext-2026-5.jpg 990w, https://cdn.dental-tribune.com/dti/0001/7d1c5b75/cmVzaXplKHc9MTY1MDtoPTEyMjApOnNoYXJwZW4obGV2ZWw9MCk6b3V0cHV0KGZvcm1hdD1qcGVnKQ/up/dt/2026/10/HeyGears-to-showcase-dental-3D-printing-workflows-at-Formnext-2026-5.jpg 1650w, https://cdn.dental-tribune.com/dti/0001/f7046ff7/cmVzaXplKHc9MTk4MDtoPTE0NjQpOnNoYXJwZW4obGV2ZWw9MCk6b3V0cHV0KGZvcm1hdD1qcGVnKQ/up/dt/2026/10/HeyGears-to-showcase-dental-3D-printing-workflows-at-Formnext-2026-5.jpg 1980w, https://cdn.dental-tribune.com/dti/0001/4ea143b6/cmVzaXplKHc9MjMxMDtoPTE3MDgpOnNoYXJwZW4obGV2ZWw9MCk6b3V0cHV0KGZvcm1hdD1qcGVnKQ/up/dt/2026/10/HeyGears-to-showcase-dental-3D-printing-workflows-at-Formnext-2026-5.jpg 2310w, https://cdn.dental-tribune.com/dti/0001/5bf56287/cmVzaXplKHc9MjY0MDtoPTE5NTIpOnNoYXJwZW4obGV2ZWw9MCk6b3V0cHV0KGZvcm1hdD1qcGVnKQ/up/dt/2026/10/HeyGears-to-showcase-dental-3D-printing-workflows-at-Formnext-2026-5.jpg 2640w\" type=\"image/jpeg\"><img src=\"https://cdn.dental-tribune.com/dti/0001/d905353d/cmVzaXplKHc9MTMyMDtoPTk3Nik6c2hhcnBlbihsZXZlbD0wKTpvdXRwdXQoZm9ybWF0PWpwZWcp/up/dt/2026/10/HeyGears-to-showcase-dental-3D-printing-workflows-at-Formnext-2026-5.jpg\" alt=\"HeyGears Cloud is a SaaS platform for integrated digital production management. (Image: HeyGears)\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\t</picture><p>HeyGears Cloud is a SaaS platform for integrated digital production management. (Image: HeyGears)</p>\n\t<p>Another key attraction will be HeyGears’ One-Piece denture solution, which uses dual-material digital light processing. The UltraCraft MMF 3D printer prints and fuses denture base and tooth materials during a single printing process, producing an integrated one-piece denture without the need for adhesive bonding between separately printed components. Through this technology, HeyGears aims to break traditional manufacturing barriers and redefine digital dentures with a new category that brings together fit, comfort, natural aesthetics and structural reliability.</p>\n<p>HeyGears’ One-Piece denture solution is designed to improve structural integrity and stability and to reduce sites for bacteria to accumulate. Aesthetics are equally central to the workflow. The One-Piece denture solution is designed to preserve tooth morphology and lifelike details for a natural-looking result. In addition to HeyGears’ own materials, the Lucitone Digital Print Denture resins from Dentsply Sirona are validated for use with the solution, offering users a broad selection of tooth and gingival shades.</p>\n<picture><source srcset=\"https://cdn.dental-tribune.com/dti/0001/072291da/cmVzaXplKHc9MTMyMDtoPTk3Nik6c2hhcnBlbihsZXZlbD0wKTpvdXRwdXQoZm9ybWF0PXdlYnAp/up/dt/2026/10/HeyGears-to-showcase-dental-3D-printing-workflows-at-Formnext-2026-1.jpg 1320w, https://cdn.dental-tribune.com/dti/0001/44b46a12/cmVzaXplKHc9Mjk3O2g9MjIwKTpzaGFycGVuKGxldmVsPTApOm91dHB1dChmb3JtYXQ9d2VicCk/up/dt/2026/10/HeyGears-to-showcase-dental-3D-printing-workflows-at-Formnext-2026-1.jpg 297w, https://cdn.dental-tribune.com/dti/0001/a2fc1a22/cmVzaXplKHc9NDYyO2g9MzQyKTpzaGFycGVuKGxldmVsPTApOm91dHB1dChmb3JtYXQ9d2VicCk/up/dt/2026/10/HeyGears-to-showcase-dental-3D-printing-workflows-at-Formnext-2026-1.jpg 462w, https://cdn.dental-tribune.com/dti/0001/d7378ae3/cmVzaXplKHc9NjYwO2g9NDg4KTpzaGFycGVuKGxldmVsPTApOm91dHB1dChmb3JtYXQ9d2VicCk/up/dt/2026/10/HeyGears-to-showcase-dental-3D-printing-workflows-at-Formnext-2026-1.jpg 660w, https://cdn.dental-tribune.com/dti/0001/3c779ad3/cmVzaXplKHc9OTkwO2g9NzMyKTpzaGFycGVuKGxldmVsPTApOm91dHB1dChmb3JtYXQ9d2VicCk/up/dt/2026/10/HeyGears-to-showcase-dental-3D-printing-workflows-at-Formnext-2026-1.jpg 990w, https://cdn.dental-tribune.com/dti/0001/d6bfc609/cmVzaXplKHc9MTY1MDtoP