ears-to-showcase-dental-3D-printing-workflows-at-Formnext-2026-4.jpg 462w, https://cdn.dental-tribune.com/dti/0001/d969ef57/cmVzaXplKHc9NjYwO2g9NDg4KTpzaGFycGVuKGxldmVsPTApOm91dHB1dChmb3JtYXQ9d2VicCk/up/dt/2026/10/HeyGears-to-showcase-dental-3D-printing-workflows-at-Formnext-2026-4.jpg 660w, https://cdn.dental-tribune.com/dti/0001/a3a29f00/cmVzaXplKHc9OTkwO2g9NzMyKTpzaGFycGVuKGxldmVsPTApOm91dHB1dChmb3JtYXQ9d2VicCk/up/dt/2026/10/HeyGears-to-showcase-dental-3D-printing-workflows-at-Formnext-2026-4.jpg 990w, https://cdn.dental-tribune.com/dti/0001/3d2c1e4f/cmVzaXplKHc9MTY1MDtoPTEyMjApOnNoYXJwZW4obGV2ZWw9MCk6b3V0cHV0KGZvcm1hdD13ZWJwKQ/up/dt/2026/10/HeyGears-to-showcase-dental-3D-printing-workflows-at-Formnext-2026-4.jpg 1650w, https://cdn.dental-tribune.com/dti/0001/98f7ccb9/cmVzaXplKHc9MTk4MDtoPTE0NjQpOnNoYXJwZW4obGV2ZWw9MCk6b3V0cHV0KGZvcm1hdD13ZWJwKQ/up/dt/2026/10/HeyGears-to-showcase-dental-3D-printing-workflows-at-Formnext-2026-4.jpg 1980w, https://cdn.dental-tribune.com/dti/0001/46655eb6/cmVzaXplKHc9MjMxMDtoPTE3MDgpOnNoYXJwZW4obGV2ZWw9MCk6b3V0cHV0KGZvcm1hdD13ZWJwKQ/up/dt/2026/10/HeyGears-to-showcase-dental-3D-printing-workflows-at-Formnext-2026-4.jpg 2310w, https://cdn.dental-tribune.com/dti/0001/af6fff84/cmVzaXplKHc9MjY0MDtoPTE5NTIpOnNoYXJwZW4obGV2ZWw9MCk6b3V0cHV0KGZvcm1hdD13ZWJwKQ/up/dt/2026/10/HeyGears-to-showcase-dental-3D-printing-workflows-at-Formnext-2026-4.jpg 2640w\" type=\"image/webp\"> <source srcset=\"https://cdn.dental-tribune.com/dti/0001/3f305ae3/cmVzaXplKHc9MTMyMDtoPTk3Nik6c2hhcnBlbihsZXZlbD0wKTpvdXRwdXQoZm9ybWF0PWpwZWcp/up/dt/2026/10/HeyGears-to-showcase-dental-3D-printing-workflows-at-Formnext-2026-4.jpg 1320w, https://cdn.dental-tribune.com/dti/0001/8af49e02/cmVzaXplKHc9Mjk3O2g9MjIwKTpzaGFycGVuKGxldmVsPTApOm91dHB1dChmb3JtYXQ9anBlZyk/up/dt/2026/10/HeyGears-to-showcase-dental-3D-printing-workflows-at-Formnext-2026-4.jpg 297w, https://cdn.dental-tribune.com/dti/0001/41075683/cmVzaXplKHc9NDYyO2g9MzQyKTpzaGFycGVuKGxldmVsPTApOm91dHB1dChmb3JtYXQ9anBlZyk/up/dt/2026/10/HeyGears-to-showcase-dental-3D-printing-workflows-at-Formnext-2026-4.jpg 462w, https://cdn.dental-tribune.com/dti/0001/a840fdbd/cmVzaXplKHc9NjYwO2g9NDg4KTpzaGFycGVuKGxldmVsPTApOm91dHB1dChmb3JtYXQ9anBlZyk/up/dt/2026/10/HeyGears-to-showcase-dental-3D-printing-workflows-at-Formnext-2026-4.jpg 660w, https://cdn.dental-tribune.com/dti/0001/60ccc77c/cmVzaXplKHc9OTkwO2g9NzMyKTpzaGFycGVuKGxldmVsPTApOm91dHB1dChmb3JtYXQ9anBlZyk/up/dt/2026/10/HeyGears-to-showcase-dental-3D-printing-workflows-at-Formnext-2026-4.jpg 990w, https://cdn.dental-tribune.com/dti/0001/c9e31ea0/cmVzaXplKHc9MTY1MDtoPTEyMjApOnNoYXJwZW4obGV2ZWw9MCk6b3V0cHV0KGZvcm1hdD1qcGVnKQ/up/dt/2026/10/HeyGears-to-showcase-dental-3D-printing-workflows-at-Formnext-2026-4.jpg 1650w, https://cdn.dental-tribune.com/dti/0001/a134665c/cmVzaXplKHc9MTk4MDtoPTE0NjQpOnNoYXJwZW4obGV2ZWw9MCk6b3V0cHV0KGZvcm1hdD1qcGVnKQ/up/dt/2026/10/HeyGears-to-showcase-dental-3D-printing-workflows-at-Formnext-2026-4.jpg 1980w, https://cdn.dental-tribune.com/dti/0001/dff48a90/cmVzaXplKHc9MjMxMDtoPTE3MDgpOnNoYXJwZW4obGV2ZWw9MCk6b3V0cHV0KGZvcm1hdD1qcGVnKQ/up/dt/2026/10/HeyGears-to-showcase-dental-3D-printing-workflows-at-Formnext-2026-4.jpg 2310w, https://cdn.dental-tribune.com/dti/0001/2ab524b9/cmVzaXplKHc9MjY0MDtoPTE5NTIpOnNoYXJwZW4obGV2ZWw9MCk6b3V0cHV0KGZvcm1hdD1qcGVnKQ/up/dt/2026/10/HeyGears-to-showcase-dental-3D-printing-workflows-at-Formnext-2026-4.jpg 2640w\" type=\"image/jpeg\"><img src=\"https://cdn.dental-tribune.com/dti/0001/3f305ae3/cmVzaXplKHc9MTMyMDtoPTk3Nik6c2hhcnBlbihsZXZlbD0wKTpvdXRwdXQoZm9ybWF0PWpwZWcp/up/dt/2026/10/HeyGears-to-showcase-dental-3D-printing-workflows-at-Formnext-2026-4.jpg\" alt=\"HeyGears’ high-transparency splint workflow is designed to produce clear, glossy surfaces and thus reduce the need for manual polishing. (Image: HeyGears)\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\t</picture><p>HeyGears’ high-transparency splint workflow is designed to produce clear, glossy surfaces and thus reduce the need for manual polishing. (Image: HeyGears)</p>\n\t<p>HeyGears will also showcase its high-transparency workflow based on the UltraCraft A2D HD desktop 3D printer, the HT Resin Tank and the Pulsing Release Module, an optional accessory designed to reduce peeling forces during printing. The combination supports applications such as splints and flexible dentures.</p>\n<p>For splint fabrication, the high-transparency workflow is designed to produce highly transparent, glossy surfaces directly through 3D printing, reducing or eliminating the need for manual polishing. In HeyGears laboratory testing using Keystone Industries’ KeyPrint KeySplint Hard Clear and the HeyGears HT Resin Tank, light transmittance reached up to 88%. Optimised washing and post-polymerisation are intended to help maintain clarity and consistency.</p>\n<p>The same focus on aesthetics and production efficiency extends to flexible dentures. By combining multi-shade transparent resins with high-transparency printing, the workflow is intended to create a more natural appearance while providing the flexibility, rebound and durability required for everyday use. High-precision 3D printing and streamlined post-processing further simplify production, enable pre-polished results and reduce hands-on finishing.</p>\n<p>Dental professionals can find out more about HeyGears’ workflows and attend live demonstrations at Booth C01 in Hall 12.1. More information can be found at <a href=\"https://www.heygears.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">heygears.com</a>.</p>","kind":"full"}